{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/items/461127/", "pk": 461127, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/", "pk": 93331, "shortname": "animalcenter", "name": "Helen Woodward Animal Center", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Outreaches", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 6, "unicode": "Outreaches", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 360.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 360.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 9062, "description": "", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#We are looking forward to seeing you!\nEducation Outreaches include animal encounters and interactive educational activities that meet grade-level STEM and NGSS.\n- If you chose the 60-minute version and did not select STEM as part of our time with you, we should leave paperwork copies for each teacher which explains the STEM activity we would have done and provides a template if applicable. If you did not receive this, please email us and we can send it electronically to you.\n- *Some* of our STEM activities include follow-up activities for the class to complete after we leave, if the teacher so desires. We will leave paperwork copies for each teacher which explains the follow up activity and provides any applicable templates. If you did not receive this and believe you should have, please email us and we can send it electronically to you if applicable.\n- - -\n**CLASSROOM EXPECTATIONS**\n- We will arrive ~15 minutes before the start time to check in, set up our equipment, and let the animals get used to their surroundings. It is very helpful if we can set up before the children are present.\n- Please inform us before the visit where we should park if there are special instructions. It is easier to unload our vehicle if we can park close to the building. We can move our vehicle after we unload if necessary.\n- An indoor area where the students can sit comfortably in a half circle so everyone can easily see is required. If an outdoors location is the only option, it limits our animals to only reptiles and invertebrates for animal safety purposes.\n- Remaining in the same location throughout the visit and having each class come to us is necessary. This reduces stress on the animals and helps us stay on time as we bring many supplies with us that are difficult to keep packing/unpacking between classes.\n- In order to best serve the students and maintain animal health and safety, we only present to one class at a time (20-30 students maximum). \n- Our staff are trained on positive classroom management strategies, but we appreciate continued support from the teacher to ensure the best experience for the children and the animals.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "From $255 • Bring the critters to your classroom", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/animalcenter/items/461127/images/960356/", "pk": 960356, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/NRimou5cQOqV2aIXQ10i", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackconten